            "heading_size": "sub-heading",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>The ultimate balance of style, comfort, and protection.</strong></p><p>Crafted to protect your phone without compromising your look. Each case features precision engineering, high-grade materials, and long-lasting print quality.</p><ul><li><strong>Vibrant & Fade-Proof:</strong> High-definition graphics engineered to stay bright.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Drop Protection:</strong> Reinforced edges and elevated bumpers keep your device safe from accidental falls.</li><li><strong>Ergonomic Grip:</strong> Smooth tactile finish with easy-to-press button covers.</li><li><strong>Community Approved:</strong> Over <strong>50,000+</strong> cases delivered to satisfied customers worldwide.</li></ul>",
